  "description": {
    "text": "The 2025 Extra Battle Day tournaments at Pokémon Card Gyms from 1 January 2025. Every player got Irida 219/SV-P and a promo card pack holding one of twelve cards with the Extra Battle Day logo, 220/SV-P to 231/SV-P; tournament and rock paper scissors winners got another pack. From 1 July 2025 the participation prize was Roxanne 290/SV-P."
